{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011eBiME7Uo9c67iyCSubUjZ","type":"tool_result","content":"135:  ctx.onCommit(() => ctx.poke(ctx.threadId));\n290:// close→summary enqueues ride the completion commit; its onCommit\n323:      onApplied({ db, onCommit: hooks.register });\n---\ncheck-boundaries.mjs\ncheck-test-immutability.mjs\nfc07-gate-self-test.mjs\nlint.mjs\nrecord-red-manifest.mjs\n/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs:62:// thread-view consumes the messages/turns report surfaces and the threads\n/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs:63:// resolver; intake-stream gains the thread-view surface for the boundary\n/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs:66:// thread-view → messages/turns → intake-stream (the last edges are type-only\n/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs:72:  \"intake-stream\": new Set([\"threads\", \"messages\", \"turns\", \"thread-view\"]),\n/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs:75:  \"thread-view\": new Set([\"threads\", \"messages\", \"turns\"]),\n---\n# Selection goldens (Epic 03 Story 2, G1–G4)\n\nCommitted expected arrangements for the band-selection walk (tech design\n§Deterministic Algorithms), consumed by `test/view-select-golden.test.ts`.\nEach golden pins the exact arrangement a compact must produce on the Story-0\nfixture (or its straggler variant) under explicit params: subject ids per\nband, form used, compact point, covered_from, and gaps.\n\n**Goldens are immutable once committed.** An implementation that disagrees\nwith a golden is wrong until the *design rule* is shown wrong — that takes the\ndeviation process, not a golden edit. The expected values were hand-derived\nfrom the design's rules (rules 1–6, the pinned ≤/newest-first/newest-member\ntie-breakers) against the fixture's deterministic token costs.\n\nRegenerated once under impl-lead ruling\n`02-smart-compact-story-run-001-ruling-013`: the first commit's goldens\nencoded extra-rule selection behavior (smooth-obligate inclusion,\npartial-chunk retreat, suppressed brief loner); these goldens encode the\nliteral rules.\n\n| File | Case | Rule under test |\n|------|------|-----------------|\n| `g1-proportions.json` | G1 | shares → bands across the full gradient |\n| `g2-edge-inclusion.json` | G2a | entry exactly filling the remainder is included (≤) |\n| `g2-edge-exclusion.json` | G2b | one token under the exact fill → excluded, band stops |\n| `g3-oversized-loner.json` | G3 | oversized entry on an otherwise-empty band represents alone |\n| `g4-turnless-straggler.json` | G4 | rule 6: straggler rides the following turn's band entry; trailing straggler is tail |\n\n## Regeneration (only with a granted deviation)\n\nThe actual arrangement for any params can be printed by running the golden\nsuite with `GOLDEN_DUMP=1`:\n\n```\nGOLDEN_DUMP=1 npx vitest run test/view-select-golden.test.ts\n```\n\nEach case logs its actual `{compactPoint, coveredFrom, arrangement, gaps}`\nJSON; verify the new values against the design rules by hand before replacing\na file, and record the deviation that made the old golden wrong.\n---\n{\n  \"name\": \"lhc\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"description\": \"Long Horizon Context SDK and CLI core.\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"./dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\",\n      \"import\": \"./dist/index.js\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"bin\": {\n    \"lhc\": \"./dist/cli.js\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"README.md\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"clean\": \"rm -rf dist\",\n    \"build\": \"pnpm run clean && tsc -p tsconfig.json\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit && tsc -p tsconfig.test.json\",\n    \"lint\": \"node scripts/lint.mjs\",\n    \"boundaries\": \"node scripts/check-boundaries.mjs\",\n    \"dev:cli\": \"tsx src/cli.ts\",\n    \"test\": \"vitest run\",\n    \"red-verify\": \"pnpm run build && pnpm run typecheck && pnpm run lint && pnpm run boundaries\",\n    \"verify\": \"pnpm run red-verify && echo 'SKIP: cli-process suite — run verify-all' && vitest run\",\n    \"green-verify\": \"pnpm run verify && node scripts/check-test-immutability.mjs\",\n    \"verify-all\": \"pnpm run red-verify && LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1 vitest run\"\n  },\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=24\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"effect\": \"^3.21.2\",\n    \"js-tiktoken\": \"^1.0.21\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@types/node\": \"^24.12.4\",\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.22.4\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.9.3\",\n    \"vitest\": \"^4.1.8\"\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a19a2d2c-079f-4c8b-a6d9-08d7c8df8763","uuid":"44f798e1-872b-4fa0-beeb-13d159518fad","timestamp":"2026-06-11T17:30:42.143Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"135:  ctx.onCommit(() => ctx.poke(ctx.threadId));\n290:// close→summary enqueues ride the completion commit; its onCommit\n323:      onApplied({ db, onCommit: hooks.register });\n---\ncheck-boundaries.mjs\ncheck-test-immutability.mjs\nfc07-gate-self-test.mjs\nlint.mjs\nrecord-red-manifest.mjs\n/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs:62:// thread-view consumes the messages/turns report surfaces and the threads\n/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs:63:// resolver; intake-stream gains the thread-view surface for the boundary\n/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs:66:// thread-view → messages/turns → intake-stream (the last edges are type-only\n/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/scripts/chec